Gemini Isaac ROS Workbench

An independent integration project inspired by https://github.com/orbbec/isaac_ros-dev.
It is not an official NVIDIA or Orbbec distribution.

Project-authored code currently has no blanket license grant. Public visibility
does not replace a license. Copyright 2026 xensexyq.

scripts/nvblox_static_validation.launch.py is adapted from NVIDIA Isaac ROS
nvblox_examples_bringup/launch/examples/isaac_sim_example.launch.py. It retains
its NVIDIA copyright and Apache-2.0 header. The adaptation selects the isolated
multithreaded executor. See LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

The architecture HTML renderer is generated using arch-flow:
https://github.com/xensexyq/xcodex-skills (skills/arch-flow).

OrbbecSDK_ROS2 sources and x64 SDK binaries are downloaded on demand from the
official Orbbec repository. Their original LICENSE, NOTICE and SDK licenses
remain in the downloaded tree; they are not relicensed by this project.

NVIDIA container images, ROS binary packages and NGC sample datasets are
downloaded from their official sources and remain subject to their original
licenses and terms. This repository does not redistribute those artifacts.
